# Wire events a peer sends (format: input-emulation/src/contract.rs).
# "Hi" typed with Shift, then Ctrl+Alt held for a hotkey when the peer is
# lost. Key codes are evdev: 42 LeftShift, 35 H, 23 I, 29 LeftCtrl,
# 56 LeftAlt. A capture repeats the press of a held key (auto-repeat).
key 42 1
mods 1 0 0 0
key 35 1
key 35 0
key 42 0
mods 0 0 0 0
key 23 1
key 23 1
key 23 1
key 23 0
key 29 1
mods 4 0 0 0
key 56 1
mods 12 0 0 0
